<Library LVVersion="21008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">&lt;b&gt;Signal voltage Generation&lt;/b&gt; library provides options to generate different waveform voltage signals tones (single/multi) over a given generation time(s) on analog output terminals of DAQmX. This library is applicable for Test Scale analog output module (TS-15110).
